__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Per-job logs: every bundled job line ends `> D{drug}_{exp}.log`, writing into the
# method directory it was launched from.
*.log

# Internal post-mortem kept locally; references tooling this repo does not ship.
ArchitecturePerformanceExperiments/LP-NN/JOB_FAILURE_ANALYSIS.md

# Job lists under ArchitecturePerformanceExperiments/*/jobs/ are tracked (relative paths to <repo>/Data).

